<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Invitation created</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body class="portal-page"><div class="top-line"></div><main class="portal-wrap"><div class="portal-brand"><span class="brand-mark">✦</span><span>Invitation created</span></div><section class="portal-card"><p>Your single-use invitation link is ready.</p><p>It expires at <strong><%= expiresAt %> UTC</strong>. Anyone with the link can use it once, so share it privately.</p><div class="copy-row"><input id="inviteUrl" readonly value="<%= inviteUrl %>"><button class="primary-button" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('inviteUrl').value).then(()=>this.textContent='Copied!')">Copy</button></div></section><a class="login-button" href="/forum">Back to forum</a></main></body></html>